{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:01 2026-08-11 HKT</p>\n\n<p>香港興業及中信泰富合作發展的愉景灣現樓新盤滿．意2期，自推出以來錄逾1.5萬宗查詢，即日起開放單位預約參觀，計劃季內推售，定價將參考港島南區及中西半山豪宅。</p>\n<p>香港興業銷售及市務助理總經理陳秀珍表示，滿．意系列命名至今接獲超過15,000宗查詢，當中約6成為本地客、約2成內地客，以及約1成多是外籍人士。項目即日起開放現樓單位預約參觀，計劃季內推售，定價將參考港島南區及中西半山豪宅。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7b0566aadbe965da512b8314a6f4c3ab/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_00_22.jpeg\"/>\n<p>樓市方面，她表示今年至今樓價已升接近8%，現時相對上半年升幅放緩，但港股有稍回升，對後市有信心。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/390c2a3d09970b74767abf838f05541b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_01_51.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>即日起開放8個單位預約參觀</h2>\n<p>發展商今日首度開放8個單位參觀，均位於1座10樓及11樓全層，戶型涵蓋1房至4房3套連儲物室，面積由469至1,757 方呎。連裝修單位包括1A座11樓A室，面積1,757方呎的4房戶等。</p>\n<h2>愉景灣滿．意1A座11樓A室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a83746eae41ca77ef6b1db9d853f9f1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/314bdcb33532a8bad514ea5230f1e1fa/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb7ffbc2b56382afe479ccfe6a910ebc/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e35aec619a2336b50c3a034933c33e4a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_38_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4af8b2ab92a96b9d597d8c2480364d9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/31195f3cbaf1a8b327bb00dbe1fa9ec5/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f8ab2ca678d330801e1b81693aad7f2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_37_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1118481b66a6b60be30f354ec3483005/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0788b29bd3e4308e36fad34eee789f52/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89e88462e4fc5bdcbcfefa08ef1d1c02/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_39_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/754979eb76fdbeb3a28922c118bcd5b5/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_37_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d883572c80bcf8ad75cf7218d5916fd/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_39_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aad08c3bbf01c18daa79632e4fd57ccb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_39_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb505cb604bae333badb3a2f6756e9fe/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_39.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5d2959cf4a5b30c9d241fb4d0336ce2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6ddf07dde3c1eb594ea7f6825fbf5b6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_31_38_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>發展商指，各單位的傢俬布置以自然柔和的色系與質感為主調，突顯愉景灣擁山巒、環抱海岸線的自然環境，打造愉景灣獨特的度假式生活氛圍。</p>\n<h2>愉景灣滿．意1B座11樓B室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ac5255e91daf2521bd4b29f999aee29/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_15_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f72eecff2dc5e8900f54ac84549f7ed1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7039228e0e20b8e08eb9585509b8f2b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_16_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f649ddc8c1989cbab45f3cbde83c870/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_16_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/829b598b7d17618993cf067059425f30/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_16_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9f345edefceade2f00248eaf8ef44fe/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_16_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8135637d0d81f3fb83638e1101343d4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aacf0ad0991e5b65be32d11eb1f68b96/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_17.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>愉景灣滿．意1B座11樓C室：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c0d09847d0b2c53a76f6781f65454b3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_58.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db26c89e1488f25bacc21f247af4d397/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_59_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/514a41a510bfb8168b47fe9eee4e74a2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_59_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd857ddac6688d7aecc5172fcc07d599/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_59_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce6a25f5a8ae973f81211f92c3831548/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-11_at_14_32_59.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T09:39:11.274377+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":488,"images":31,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}